        "note": {
          "en": "The first 3 digits identify the township or district; 6-digit codes (3+3) replaced the 5-digit form in 2020.",
          "zh": "前 3 位代表乡镇市区；2020 年起以 6 位（3+3）取代 5 位。"
        }
